<%- include('../partials/header') %>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/module-builder.css">
<section class="page-title"><p class="eyebrow">Core Administration</p><h1><%= project.name %> &mdash; Development Setup</h1></section>
<section class="panel">
  <p>Approved <%= new Date(project.new_app_setup.approvedAt).toLocaleString('en-NZ') %>. Oregon, lowest paid Web Service and connected separate database.
    <strong>Development only; not production approval.</strong></p>
  <ol id="setup-resources">
    <li>Private repository: <%= project.repository || 'Not created' %></li>
    <li>WHS framework: <%= project.framework_commit ? 'Installed' : 'Not installed' %></li>
    <li>Separate database: <%= environment.config.databaseId || 'Not created' %></li>
    <li>Connected Web Service: <%= environment.config.serviceId || 'Not created' %></li>
    <li>Deployment/database health and named tester access: <%= project.new_app_setup.readyAt ? 'Passed at ' + new Date(project.new_app_setup.readyAt).toLocaleString('en-NZ') : 'Not yet completed' %></li>
  </ol>
  <p id="setup-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"><%= project.active_operation ? 'An operation needs to finish or be inspected before resuming. Use technical details.' : 'Start or resume the approved setup below. Completed resources will not be recreated.' %></p>
  <form id="development-setup" action="/module-builder/<%= project.id %>/setup/step" method="post" class="mb-actions">
    <input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>">
    <button class="button button-primary" type="submit"<%= project.active_operation ? ' disabled' : '' %>><%= project.new_app_setup.readyAt ? 'Recheck development starter' : 'Start / Resume approved setup' %></button>
  </form>
  <p>Keep this page open while running. Setup stops on an error, uncertain provider result, changed approved settings or after 15 minutes.
    Reload and resume for slow deployments. Do not register another app to retry. Already-created resources remain billable.</p>
  <div class="mb-actions" id="setup-links">
    <a class="button" href="/module-builder/<%= project.id %>">Technical details / inspect and reconcile</a>
    <a class="button" href="/module-builder">All development apps</a>
    <% if (project.repository) { %><a class="button" href="https://github.com/<%= project.repository %>">Open repository</a><% } %>
    <% if (environment.config.serviceId) { %><a class="button" href="https://dashboard.render.com/web/<%= environment.config.serviceId %>">Open Render service</a><% } %>
    <% if (environment.config.databaseId) { %><a class="button" href="https://dashboard.render.com/d/<%= environment.config.databaseId %>">Open Render database</a><% } %>
    <% if (environment.config.appUrl) { %><a class="button" href="<%= environment.config.appUrl %>">Open development app</a><% } %>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="panel">
  <h2>Before wider access or integration</h2>
  <p>Sign in as an administrator and a selected tester; confirm unassigned users are denied. Test saving/reloading real app features in this separate development database,
    accessibility, error handling and backups. The automatic check confirms only the starter deployment and database connection, not sign-in, application readiness or the complete Advisory.</p>
  <div id="setup-history">
    <h2>Recorded operations</h2>
    <% if (!history.length) { %><p>No provider operations started yet.</p><% } %>
    <% history.forEach(operation => { %><p><strong><%= actions[operation.kind] || operation.kind %>: <%= operation.status %></strong><br><%= operation.message || '' %></p><% }) %>
  </div>
</section>
<script src="/new-development-app.js" defer></script>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
